      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you provide a detailed biochemical breakdown of the Renin-Angiotensin-Aldosterone System (RAAS)? Specifically, I need the precise enzymatic steps involved in the conversion of angiotensinogen to Angiotensin II, and the specific role of the Angiotensin-Converting Enzyme (ACE) in this cascade. I'm reviewing this for the USMLE Step 1, so please maintain a high level of technical rigor.",
